[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Authored accepted-grid admission boundaries

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: CONFIGURED-GRID-CARDINALITY-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Admit a single authored interval and enforce its step budget
STATEMENT: >>>
An accepted time grid shall admit exactly two endpoints for one interval and
shall reject a grid containing more than max_steps+1points. Positive exact
dyadic grids within the authored interval budget shall remain admissible.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Verification: two_endpoints_are_a_valid_single_interval_grid and
seeded_dyadic_grids_use_the_exact_authored_interval_budget;64Proptest cases,
seed2026111921. This is grid admission, not a trajectory accuracy guarantee.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: CONFIGURED-GRID-ROUNDOFF-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Preserve the represented step-roundoff boundary in seconds
STATEMENT: >>>
Accepted-grid maximum-gap admission shall preserve the existing inclusive
max_step_s+32*binary64_epsilon*stop_s allowance. A represented gap at that
boundary shall be admitted and the adjacent representable larger gap refused.
The allowance shall scale with stop time, preserving its units of seconds.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Inferred numerical protocol from the existing implementation, recorded as Draft;
not a new voltage/current accuracy tolerance. Verification:
represented_step_roundoff_boundary_is_inclusive_and_scaled_by_stop constructs
the stop=2,max_step=1 boundary by64ULPs of1, independently of production math.
<<<

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: CONFIGURED-GRID-PREFLIGHT-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Keep the recording preflight limit inclusive before callbacks
STATEMENT: >>>
The accepted-grid preflight shall admit exactly2,000,000requested retained
scalars and reject a larger request as ResourceExhausted before observer
publication. Observer cancellation after a valid initial sample shall retain
its Cancelled outcome instead of being mistaken for budget exhaustion.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Verification: recording_preflight_admits_exact_limit_before_callback_cancellation
uses20independent zero-excitation resistors and the actual LU provider. Requests
100000versus100001points distinguish2,000,000from2,000,020scalars. Exact-limit
execution stops after one analytically zero sample; this does not measure full
two-million-scalar retention or establish a completed trajectory.
<<<
